@PortfolioMap.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5199
@token = replace-with-access-token

GET {{PortfolioMap.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Public profile
GET {{PortfolioMap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Public profile not found
GET {{PortfolioMap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/not-found
Accept: application/json

### Update current profile
PUT {{PortfolioMap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "phoneNumber": "0901234567",
  "universityId": 1,
  "major": "Công nghệ thông tin",
  "githubUrl": "https://github.com/nguyenvana",
  "linkedInUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/nguyenvana"
}

### Change password
PUT {{PortfolioMap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "OldPassword1",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword1",
  "confirmNewPassword": "NewPassword1"
}

### Upload avatar
POST {{PortfolioMap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=avatarBoundary

--avatarBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--avatarBoundary--
